CHEAP HINT#7

CLERGY MISSIONS ARE NOT VERY DIFFICULT AT THEIR EARLY STAGES. SOON
HOWEVER THEY BECOME AS DIFFICULT AS QUESTS. ON THE OTHER HAND QUESTS
START OUT TOUGH. IT IS ALWAYS POSSIBLE TO LUCK INTO SOLVING A MISSION
BUT A QUEST USUALLY REQUIRES A GREAT DEAL OF ADVENTURING.

MISSIONS USUALLY REQUIRE YOU TO GO TO AN EASILY FOUND LOCATION AND
STAND IN A SPECIFIC SPOT. THIS IS DESIGNED TO TEST YOUR METTLE TO
MAKE SURE YOU HAD THE GNARDS TO GET TO THE LOCATION.

QUESTS WILL ALMOST CERTAINLY ALWAYS REQUIRE A GREAT DEAL OF SOLVING
AND CERTAIN SKILLS WILL HAVE TO BE HIGH ENOUGH TO READ FOREIGN HINTS
AND MOVE TO BLOCKED LOCATIONS.

ALWAYS LOOK FOR THE SQUARE WHICH WILL TELL YOU YOUR MISSION OR QUEST
IS FINISHED BEFORE BELIEVING IT IS. THIS IS A MESSAGE FROM THE QUEST
GODS TELLING YOU "GOOD JOB". UNTIL YOU SEE THIS MESSAGE YOUR QUEST
IS NOT OVER.